  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 35 + (25 × 3 − 45) ÷ 2 + (15 × 4) = 125\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers :\n\nOption 1) 25 and 35\n\n35 + (25 × 3 − 45) ÷ 2 + (15 × 4) = 125 ⇒ 25 + (35 × 3 − 45) ÷ 2 + (15 × 4) = 125\n\n⇒ 25 + __**(35 × 3**__ − 45) ÷ 2 + __**(15 × 4)**__ = 125\n\n⇒ 25 + __**(105 − 45)**__ ÷ 2 + 60 = 125\n\n⇒ 25 + __**26.25 ÷ 2**__ + 60 = 125\n\n⇒ __**25 + **13.125** + 60**__ = 125</p&",
